            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "@cloone8, in #948 this seems to have been narrowed down to depend on the exact width of the total window. For example, if it is wide enough to contain \"focus + non-focus + non-focus\" but not wide enough to contain \"focus + preview + non-focus\", there was a flicker with some unwanted bookkeeping consequences.\r\n\r\nI think this should be resolved on latest `main`. Please feel free to re-report if you still encounter this issue after updating the plugin (even without reproducible example).",
